  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "BMMNuAbmUDhbfpCcWBRBe91nVPs=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:34:24.119Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The non-goals are as load-bearing as the goals, because each one is a thing the LB *could* do and deliberately does not:\n\n- **TLS termination** \u2014 assume a TLS-terminating edge (ALB, cloud LB, another nginx) in front. Decided per deploy: dev and CI run plain HTTP on `:8080`; prod keeps the LB on plain HTTP **behind** a separate edge. In-LB `listen 443 ssl;` is not built and is added only when a specific deploy demands it. The operational requirements this creates: the LB listener **must not** be exposed to the public internet directly, and the TLS edge owns `X-Forwarded-For` / `X-Forwarded-Proto`, which the LB honours via `set_real_ip_from <edge CIDR>` once configured.\n- **HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 to the client** \u2014 HTTP/1.1 only in the MVP, even though nginx supports h2 trivially.\n- **Authn / authz** \u2014 \"we forward headers untouched; `switchboard` remains the policy decision point.\" That single sentence is why the LB never needs to understand a credential.\n- **Rate limiting, WAF, caching** \u2014 out of scope even though nginx could do them.\n- **Dynamic service discovery** \u2014 no Consul, no Kubernetes API. Backends are `server` entries in `upstreams.conf`, reloaded on `SIGHUP` / `nginx -s reload`.\n- **Rebalancing existing documents** \u2014 pinning is sticky once established.\n\nObservability is in scope and specific: Prometheus metrics (`lb_requests_total{class,backend,status}`, `lb_request_duration_seconds{class,backend}`) on a separate internal `:9090` listener never published to the host, key=value logs carrying `request_id`, `doc_id`, `upstream_addr`, `status` and timings, and an `X-LB-Upstream` response header as a dev-only debug aid. Traces are a reserved slot for OpenTelemetry, not built.\n\n## Provenance\n- `apps/switchboard-lb/ARCHITECTURE.md` \u2014 \u00a71 Non-goals; \u00a79 Q6 (decided 2026-04-21); \u00a76.4 Observability\n\n_Extracted from the Powerhouse repository at **v6.2.2-dev.74**._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-03T07:34:24.119Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:34:24.119Z"
    }
  },
